= Petorian Media

If we ever want to be taken seriously as a country, people need to know of us. We should look into investing into media to spread our image


- @go_out
- @do_not

@go_out
title: Go Anyway
subtitle: "Look I'll only be out for an hour tops, I'll be back before your parents even arrive"
on-arrival: peter_dissent -= 5; lois_dissent += 5; quagmire_relation += 5; joe_relation += 5; cleveland_relation += 5;

Peter arrives at the Clam. He is greeted by his friends, and makes sure to explain that he cannot be out late. After a few drinks however, they have all forgotten the time. Peter returns home, wasted, at one in the morning. Lois does not speak to him the next day.

@do_not
title: Stay
subtitle: "Well, alright, I can stay home for tonight I suppose"
on-arrival: lois_dissent -= 2;

The night goes fine. Lois's father, Carter, berates Peter as usual but it's nothing he's not used to. At around 8 P.M., Peter catches a glance of his friends outside the window, and feels a deep sense of longing.
